Z||000000||jerpro||05-16-2001||06:02 PM||||This might have a simple solution but I am very "put sware word here". <BR>I filled up my gas tank and grabbed a small gas tank and filled it with one gallon and put it in my car. I just wanted to see when the gas would run out because the fiero specs say that the gas tank on a 84se will hold 10.5 gallons.<BR>The car stalled after the gas was gone I pout in th egallon , went to a gas station and filled up 7 gallons, which puts it a little above eight. <BR>What happened to the othert 2!/2 gallons that is is supposed to have?!?!?!?!?<BR>any help would be appreciated thnks.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Mark||05-16-2001||06:30 PM||||You can often "squeeze" another gallon or so of gas in the tank after the pump automatically trips off.||||reg||1
